---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/page-layouts.css';
import '../styles/story.css';
---

<Layout
title="The Greensman — a story — Mike Trounce"
description="Freddy's garden and grounds business, told in one video — hosting, the flyer, the brand, a reel that tripled a quote, a WhatsApp system, and what's next."
>
<div class="cs-page">
<a href="/" class="back-link">&larr; Mike Trounce</a>

<span class="cs-label">The canonical example</span>
<h1>The Greensman</h1>

<div class="story-video">
  <video controls preload="metadata" poster="/media/kabir-poster.jpg" playsinline>
    <source src="/media/kabir-reel.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
  </video>
</div>

<p class="cs-standfirst">
Eight fixes and counting — cheaper hosting, a corrected flyer, a rebuilt brand, this reel that tripled a quote, a WhatsApp system so leads stopped slipping through, his own following built up — with a contractor brokerage and a second YouTube channel next.
</p>

<p class="cs-foot">
<a href="/">&larr; Mike Trounce</a>
</p>
</div>
</Layout>

<style>
.story-video {
  max-width: 360px;
  margin: 2rem auto 0;
  border-radius: 20px;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: var(--bg-raised);
  box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(var(--shadow) / 0.05), 0 18px 34px -18px rgba(var(--shadow) / 0.4);
}
.story-video video {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  aspect-ratio: 9 / 16;
  object-fit: cover;
  background: #000;
}
.story-video + .cs-standfirst {
  margin-top: 1.75rem;
  text-align: center;
}
</style>
